# The sniper rifle, a shot at a time (its trigger is latched: a held button fires
# once) at a target three units away that stands still: the first shot takes its
# shield and a quarter of its health (101 damage), the second kills. Four rounds
# in the magazine: the fourth is the last, and the weapon reloads on its own.
scenario sniper_kill
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/sniper rifle/sniper rifle
ticks 300
# aim at the body
input 0 300 pitch=-0.13
# the button is pressed and let go six times, fifteen ticks apart (it is held for
# three, which is one shot, not three)
input 60 63 fire=1
input 75 78 fire=1
input 90 93 fire=1
input 105 108 fire=1
input 120 123 fire=1
input 135 138 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
